            "sample": "AI technology has become a valuable tool in education, offering students personalized learning experiences and efficient academic support.1 However, its use must be care fully managed to ensure it enhances, rather than hinders, genuine learning.2 Firstly, AI can assist in simplifying complex conceptsthrough intelligent tutoring systems, providing instant feedback and tailored studyplans.3 For example, language-learning apps use AI to adapt exercises to individual progress.4 Secondly, AI-powered tools for writing help improve writing skills without replacing students' original thinking.5 Nevertheless, over-reliance on AI may weaken critical thinking and creativity.6 Therefore, students should use AI as a supplement, not a substitute, for independent learning. In conclusion, AI technology, when used appropriately, can greatly benefit students by offering support and enhancing efficiency.7 Universities should guide students in balancingAI assistance with active engagement in learning to maximize its advantages while maintaining academic integrity.8",
