            "prompt": "Directions: Suppose the university newspaper is inviting submissions from the students for its coming edition on what in their university impresses them most. You are now to write an essay for submission. You willhave 30 minutes to write the essay. You should write atleast120 wordsbut no more than180 words.",
            "review": "",
            "sample": "What impresses me most in the university is the colorful club activities, each offering unique experiences and fostering diverse interests. Not only dot he clubs enrich our campus life, butt hey also embody the spirit of learning beyond the classroom. On the one hand, the literary clubs provide space for literary enthusiasts to interact and create.2 Here, students delve into the world of books, engage in thought- provoking discussions, and try their hand at writing. On the other hand, the drama societies bring together students with a passion for the performing arts, adding more artistic atmosphere to the university. Additionally, the sports clubs such as football and aerobics emphasize the importance of physical well-being.4 They foster teamwork and resilience, which are essential qualities in bothsports and life. These clubs provide the necessary balance between academic pursuit and interest cultivation, ensuring the all-round development of students. In conclusion, the clubs are an integral part of university life, providing students with rich opportunities to explore, learn, and grow. They make our university not just an educational institution, but a vibrant community filledwith diverse interests.6",
            "sampleNote": "1紧扣主题，指出校园里 最让“我”印象深刻的 是什么——丰富多彩的 社团活动。 2以文学社团为例诠释社 团活动的丰富多彩。 3介绍戏剧社团，进一步 展现社团文化。 4引入足球、健美操等体 育类社团例子，呈现社 团活动的丰富性。 5对全文进行概括总结， 首尾呼应。 6进行升华，指出社团活 动的意义。",
            "sampleCn": "大学里最让我印象深刻的是丰富多彩的社团活动，每个社团都提供独特的体验，并培养多样化的兴 趣。社团不仅丰富了我们的校园生活，还体现了课堂之外学习的精神。 一方面，文学社团为文学爱好者提供了交流和创作的空间。在这里，学生们深入书籍世界，参与发人深 省的讨论，并尝试亲自动笔写作。另一方面，戏剧社团将热爱表演艺术的学生聚集在一起，为大学增添了更多 的艺术气息。此外，足球和健美操等体育社团强调了身体健康的重要性。它们培养团队合作精神和适应能力， 这些都是运动和生活中必不可少的品质。这些社团为学术追求和兴趣培养提供了必要的平衡，确保了学生的全 面发展。 总之，社团是大学生活不可或缺的一部分，为学生提供了探索、学习和成长的丰富机会。它们使我们的 大学不仅仅是一所教育机构，而且是一个充满多样化兴趣的活力社区。",
