                "analysis": "【答案】 D （细节题） Take measures to promote the use of recycled plastic. 【定位】 P6 The UK government plans to tax companies which don't use at least 30% recycled plastic in their products. Additionally, the government is planning to increase the quantity of recycled plastic in the market. 英国政府计划对那些产品中回收塑料使用比例不足30%的公司征税。此外，政府还计划增加市场上回收塑料的数量。 【信号】 主体+计划信号 plans to / is planning to 双重锁定 。本段同时出现两次明显的\"计划\"信号：The UK government plans to 与 the government is planning to——主体+plan to 的合体两次出现，构成两条并列计划，是无可争议的答案句。 【替换】 tax companies which don't use at least 30% recycled plastic ↔ Take measures to promote the use of recycled plastic. 具体措施→抽象概括 increase the quantity of recycled plastic in the market ↔ promote the use of recycled plastic 增加供应=促进使用·名词化与动词化对调 【排除】 A) 偷换概念 录音原文是 tax companies which don't use at least 30% recycled plastic，30% 限定的是 recycled plastic（回收塑料），政府要求的是\"至少用30%的回收塑料\"。选项把数字 30% 原样搬过来，但偷偷把 recycled plastic 换成 new plastic（新塑料），方向完全反了——典型的\"数字原词陷阱+正话反说\"。 借用原文：tax companies which don't use at least 30% recycled plastic in their products B) 偷换概念 录音说政府计划 increase the quantity of recycled plastic in the market——增加的是回收塑料的量。选项把 recycled plastic 偷换成 new plastic（新塑料），把\"增加回收塑料供应\"扭曲成\"增加新塑料供应\"，正好相反。又是把 increase 原词留着、偷换名词的伎俩。 借用原文：the government is planning to increase the quantity of recycled plastic in the market C) 录音里 reduce plastic pollution 的目标是 reducing the enormous amount of plastic pollution in the oceans——减少海洋里的塑料污染。选项把 oceans 偷换成 local areas（本地地区），范围被偷改了；并且 reduce pollution 这件事在录音里也不是政府计划的内容，而是\"包装厂家被施压\"去做的，主体也不对。属于范围偷改+张冠李戴的双重错。 借用原文：reducing the enormous amount of plastic pollution in the oceans"
