                "answer": "C",
                "analysis": "【答案】 C （细节题） They scream to get their parents back. 【定位】 P6 When there is a relationship breakdown with their parents, children with an anxious attachment style scream and cry to get their parents to come back. But other children simply shut down and try to deal with their emotions by ignoring the situation. 当他们和父母的关系破裂时，焦虑型依附的孩子会尖叫、哭闹，把父母叫回来；而另一些孩子则会直接封闭自己，试着通过忽视这种情境来处理自己的情绪。 【信号】 对照结构 anxious …. But other children … 。信号词是 But other children——嘉宾用 But 把两类孩子的反应并排对照。这种对照句是出题铁矿，正确反应几乎都在 But 两侧之一。题干问的是 anxious 那一类，对应 But 前半部分。 【替换】 scream and cry to get their parents to come back ↔ They scream to get their parents back. 选项几乎是原句裁剪 【排除】 A) 原词陷阱 They simply shut themselves down. 抠走了录音原词 simply shut down，听到 simply shut down 就想选；但录音明确说这是 But other children(另一类，即回避型)的反应，不是焦虑型的反应。 借用原文：But other children simply shut down B) They avoid showing their emotions. 描述的是「回避情绪」，更接近回避型(But other children…try to deal with their emotions by ignoring)；焦虑型 scream and cry 反而是大力外露情绪，与本选项相反。 借用原文：try to deal with their emotions by ignoring the situation D) 原词陷阱 They attempt to ignore the whole situation. 抠走的是录音原词 ignoring the situation，听到就想选；但这同样是 But other children 那一类(回避型)的反应，不是焦虑型的反应。 借用原文：try to deal with their emotions by ignoring the situation"
