                "analysis": "【答案】 A （细节题） They may regard any difference as the end of a relationship. 【定位】 P12 However, an insecurely attached person won't. They might either attack you, get defensive, or just disappear from your life. To them, a difference, no matter how small in your eyes, signals the end of the relationship. 然而，不安全依附的人就不会这样。他们要么攻击你、要么变得防御、要么干脆从你生活里消失。在他们看来，再小的分歧，都意味着这段关系的终结。 【信号】 However + To them 双重信号锁定结论 。信号词一：However, an insecurely attached person won't——However 是转折信号，前面说安全型怎么处理，转折后才是题干所问的不安全型。信号词二：To them, a difference, no matter how small in your eyes, signals the end of the relationship.——To them 是对前面群体下定论的总结句，是嘉宾真正要传达给观众的「金句」，几乎必出题。 【替换】 To them, a difference, no matter how small in your eyes, signals the end of the relationship. ↔ They may regard any difference as the end of a relationship. 同义改写——signals ↔ regard…as，no matter how small ↔ any 【排除】 B) They are on better terms with friends and romantic partners. 是正面描述「和朋友/恋人相处更好」，但录音里嘉宾对不安全型的描述是 They might either attack you, get defensive, or just disappear from your life.，是关系处理失败的方向，选项与录音方向完全相反。 借用原文：They might either attack you, get defensive, or just disappear from your life. C) 原词陷阱 They try to express their feelings and thoughts effectively. 抠走的是录音原词 express their own feelings and thoughts effectively，听到 express…effectively 就想选；但这句话是嘉宾对 securely attached(安全型)人的描述，不是问的不安全型。 借用原文：They're able to hear what the other person is saying and express their own feelings and thoughts effectively. D) They attach more value to their relationships with others. 说「他们更看重关系」，录音通篇没有这种说法。相反，录音说他们把小分歧当作关系终结的信号，是「轻易抛弃关系」的方向，不是「更看重关系」。"
