                "analysis": "【答案】 A （细节题） Keep their traditional values and old habits. 【定位】 P5 Why are immigrants doing so well? The values and habits they bring from their own homelands help explain some of the success. 为什么移民们做得这么好？他们从故乡带来的价值观与习惯，可以解释他们部分的成功。 【信号】 设问句 Why + 解释句中的 values and habits 。Why are immigrants doing so well? 是篇章独白里典型的设问句，紧接着的 The values and habits they bring from their own homelands help explain some of the success. 是直接回答这个设问的解释句，整段功能就是「解释移民达成目标的原因」。这是篇章独白里最强的「答案信号」之一。 【替换】 The values and habits they bring from their own homelands ↔ Keep their traditional values and old habits. 「从故乡带来的价值观和习惯」=「保留传统价值观和旧习惯」 individuals must save more in order to achieve their goals ↔ Keep their traditional values and old habits. in order to achieve their goals 与题干呼应，save more 是 old habits 的具体表现 【排除】 B) 原词陷阱 选项 Find employment in competitive businesses. 盗用了原文反复出现的 businesses，但原文说的是移民自己 started businesses（自己创业），而非 find employment（找工作被雇佣），且原文从未提及行业「竞争激烈」。 借用原文：the pace at which immigrants started businesses was double that of U.S.-born individuals C) 与原文相反 选项 Borrow money from financial institutions. 盗用了原文 they borrow money from friends and family rather than a bank 里的 borrow money，但原文明确说移民是「找亲友借，而不是找银行」，financial institutions（金融机构）正好就是 bank 那一边，选项把方向反掉了。rather than 是这道题的关键否定信号。 借用原文：they borrow money from friends and family rather than a bank D) 未提及 选项 Collaborate with native-born Americans. 提出「与本土美国人合作」，但全文只出现「移民 vs 本土美国人」的对比，从未提及二者合作。属于无中生有。"
