            "prompt": "For this part, you are allowed 30 minutes to write an essay that begins with the sentence \" With the trend of Urbanization, it is vitally important for city residents to develop a stronger love for Nature. \" You can make comments, cite examples or use your personal experiences to develop your essay. You should write at least 150 words but no more than 200 words. You should copy the sentence given in quotes at the beginning of your essay.",
            "sample": "With the trend of Urbanization, it is vitally important for city residents to develop a stronger love for Nature. As concrete forests expand, many urban dwellers rarely feel the breeze, hear birds, or touch soil. A stronger bond with nature is not a luxury; it is essential for mental and physical well-being in an increasingly artificial environment. One practical way to cultivate this love is to make nature part of daily routines. For example, residents can walk in nearby parks, grow plants on balconies, or join community gardening projects. These activities reconnect people with the living world. Last year, I started visiting a small riverbank park every weekend. Watching seasons change there reduced my stress and made me more aware of environmental protection. Therefore, city governments and individuals should work together to create more green spaces and spend time in them. Only by integrating nature into urban life can residents truly develop a stronger love for it and build healthier cities for future generations.",
            "sampleCn": "【参考译文】 随着城市化的趋势，城市居民培养对自然更深厚的热爱至关重要。随着混凝土森林的扩张，许多城市居民很少感受到微风、听到鸟鸣或触摸土壤。在日益人造化的环境中，对自然的更紧密联系不是奢侈品，而是身心健康的必需品。 培养这种热爱的一个实用方法是让自然成为日常生活的一部分。例如，居民可以在附近公园散步、在阳台种植植物或参加社区园艺项目。这些活动使人们重新与有生命的世界连接。去年，我开始每个周末去一个小河岸公园。在那里观察季节变化减轻了我的压力，也使我更关注环境保护。 因此，城市政府和个人应共同努力创造更多绿色空间，并花时间置身其中。只有将自然融入城市生活，居民才能真正培养更深厚的热爱，并为后代建设更健康的城市。",
            "review": "核心任务 城市化背景下城市居民如何增强对自然的热爱 根据 write an essay that begins with the sentence 与 With the trend of Urbanization, it is vitally important for city residents to develop a stronger love for Nature. 可知，本文须围绕城市化趋势，讨论城市居民应如何培养对自然的热爱，并结合 You can make comments, cite examples or use your personal experiences to develop your essay. 展开。 读者 · 语域 面向阅卷人的正式书面语 题目未设定具体读者与身份，写作对象为六级阅卷人，语气应为正式议论文，不使用口语缩写或书信称呼。 中心立意 城市居民应把亲近自然变成日常，以缓解城市化带来的疏离 以 With the trend of Urbanization, it is vitally important for city residents to develop a stronger love for Nature. 为出发点，中心论点是：面对城市化，居民需要通过日常行动主动重建与自然的联系。 要展开的要点 城市化让居民与自然渐行渐远 描述城市扩张带来的'水泥森林'现象，说明为什么增强爱自然之心变得迫切。 日常亲近自然是培养热爱的有效途径 用具体例子或个人经历说明散步、养花、社区园艺等活动如何让居民重新感受自然。 政府与个人应共建绿色空间 从社会层面提出对策：增加绿地并鼓励居民使用，把热爱自然落实到城市生活中。",
