                "analysis": "【答案】 C （细节题） To limit communication only to their superiors. 【定位】 P2 W: One mistake people make is to limit communication only to their bosses. It's important to expand your network and include your co-workers. 女：人们犯的一个错误是只跟老板沟通。重要的是拓展人脉，把同事也包括进来。 【信号】 被问者直接应答 + 关键信息 “One mistake...” 。男人在 P1 末尾问 “Why is that? And what can we do about it?”，女人在 P2 直接以 “One mistake people make is...” 作答，One mistake people make is to limit communication only to their bosses. 就是答案句。 【替换】 limit communication only to their bosses. ↔ To limit communication only to their superiors. 同义替换：bosses = superiors 【排除】 A) 答非所问 To mix and interact with peers within the organization. 中的 mix/interact with peers 是女人后面建议 “expand your network and include your co-workers” 的同义改写，但题干问的是 “mistake”，这是正确做法而非错误。 借用原文：expand your network and include your co-workers. B) 张冠李戴 To restrict their connections exclusively to colleagues. 盗用了 include your co-workers. 中的 co-workers（colleagues 同义）与 communication/connections 概念，但把对象从 “bosses” 换成了 “colleagues”，与原文相反。 借用原文：include your co-workers. D) To underestimate their role in the company. 中的 underestimate 出现在 It's important not to underestimate your colleagues.，但这是第4段关于“不要低估同事”的内容，与第2段的 “mistake” 不是同一个。 借用原文：It's important not to underestimate your colleagues."
