                "analysis": "【答案】 D 段（强锚点） 【锚点】 forest and climate expert / necessary conditions 【定位】 D 段 Spurred by global biodiversity loss and climate change, these groups are pushing the boundary of how to revive forest cover. 'It's not a theoretical proposition,' says Walter Vergara, a forest and climate specialist at the World Resources Institute(WRI). 'It requires the right incentives, the right stakeholders, the right analysis and sufficient capital, but it can happen.' 受全球生物多樣性喪失和氣候變化的驅使，這些組織正在突破如何恢復森林覆蓋的邊界。「這不是一個理論命題，」世界資源研究所（WRI）的森林與氣候專家 Walter Vergara 說，「它需要正確的激勵、正確的利益相關者、正確的分析和充足的資本，但這是可以實現的。」 【改写】 According to a forest and climate expert ↔ says Walter Vergara, a forest and climate specialist at the World Resources Institute(WRI) 身份同義替換 the revival of forest cover ↔ revive forest cover 名詞化 can take place under the necessary conditions ↔ It requires the right incentives, the right stakeholders, the right analysis and sufficient capital, but it can happen 語義概括 【辨邻】 G 'You need to bring in private sector money,' says WRI's Vergara 與題幹的 revival of forest cover can take place under necessary conditions 話題不同。 'You need to bring in private sector money,' says WRI's Vergara, who leads the initiative"
