                "analysis": "【答案】 C 段（强锚点） 【锚点】 scores of years or even centuries 【定位】 C 段 'Does nature return by itself?' asks Arnout Asjes, Land Life Company's chief technology officer, who oversees a mix of drone and satellite imagery, big data analysis, soil enhancement, QR tagging and site-specific tree configuration designs. 'Probably, but it can take decades or hundreds of years, so we are speeding things up.' 「自然能自行恢復嗎？」Land Life Company 的首席技術官 Arnout Asjes 問道，他負責監管無人機與衛星圖像、大數據分析、土壤改良、二維碼標籤和因地制宜的樹木配置設計。「可能可以，但這需要數十年或數百年，所以我們正在加速這一過程。」 【改写】 Left alone, nature may take scores of years or even centuries to repair itself ↔ 'Does nature return by itself?' asks Arnout Asjes...'Probably, but it can take decades or hundreds of years' 多組同義替換疊加 【辨邻】 M But in the right location, perhaps all you need is time 與 no intervention from humans 強調的是不介入即可恢復，而非「需要數十到數百年」。 But in the right location, perhaps all you need is time"
