                "answer": "B",
                "analysis": "【答案】 B 段（弱锚点） 【锚点】 Land Life Company / without human intervention 【定位】 B 段 The region's dry climate and depleted soils would be a recipe for disaster in your average program to replant trees, but for the Amsterdam-based Land Life Company it's an ideal place. 'We typically operate where nature does not come back by itself,' says Jurrian Ruys, its CEO. 'We go where there are rougher conditions in terms of weather, with rough or very hot summers.' 該地區乾燥的氣候和貧瘠的土壤對普通的植樹項目來說會是災難配方，但對總部位於阿姆斯特丹的 Land Life Company 而言卻是理想之地。「我們通常在大自然無法自行恢復的地方作業，」其首席執行官 Jurrian Ruys 說，「我們去氣候條件更惡劣的地方，那裡夏季炎熱或酷暑。」 【改写】 Land Life Company's operations ↔ We typically operate 同義替換 are usually located where reforestation is impossible without human intervention ↔ where nature does not come back by itself 雙重否定改寫 【辨邻】 C 'Does nature return by itself?' asks Arnout Asjes...'Probably, but it can take decades or hundreds of years, so we are speeding things up' 雖也談 nature return by itself，但沒有說 Land Life 通常在什麼地方作業。 'Does nature return by itself?' asks Arnout Asjes...'Probably, but it can take decades or hundreds of years, so we are speeding things up'"
