                "analysis": "【答案】 C （细节题） 【判型】 题干What do around half of parents of teens do according to a new study?询问研究中的具体事实，属于对单一信息的直接考查。 【拆句】 主干为What do...parents do，according to a new study为介词短语作状语，说明信息来源。整体是简单疑问句，无否定、比较等陷阱。 【定位】 P2 A new study shows that about half of parents of teens are worried about their teens being exposed to explicit content online. 一项新研究显示，约半数青少年父母担心自己的孩子在网上接触露骨内容。 【选项】 A) 偷换概念：措施≠已实施行为 A项They set their kids' phones to filter out obscene information.把第二段中changing the settings这类可能的缓解措施，说成是父母已经采取的行动，而原文并未说半数父母已这样做。 B) 偷换概念：可能性≠实际行为 B项They try to alleviate the spread of explicit scenes on the internet.把原文there are ways to alleviate the spread（存在缓解途径）替换为父母try to alleviate（正在尝试缓解），改变了行为主体与事实状态。 C) ✓ 正确 worried ↔ concerned being exposed to explicit content online ↔ viewing indecent content online C项They feel concerned about their kids' viewing indecent content online.准确对应定位句中父母worried about孩子being exposed to explicit content online。 D) 答非所问：跨段混用话题 D项They strive to prevent their kids from spending excessive screen time.将第三段以后才出现的excessive screen time话题嫁接到第二段关于explicit content的研究结论上，答非所问。"
