            "reference": "Traditional wedding customs in china have a long history, and since the Zhou Dynasty a complete set of wedding rituals has gradually developed, some of which are still in use today. Nowadays, Chinese wedding customs have changed a lot, but the ceremony is still very grand. The wedding venue is care fully decor a ted, with the main color of red, a symbol ofjubilance, and many objects are placed to wish the couple happiness. At the wedding, the couple willbowto Heavenand Earth, to theirparents and to each other, and then hold a banquet to entertain the guest sand toast the guests to express their gratitude. Today, many young people still prefer the traditional chinese wedding, to experience the unique and beautiful chinese romance. Traditional wedding customs inChina have a long history,and since the Zhou Dynasty a complete set ofwedding rituals has gradually developed,some of which are still in use today.Nowadays,Chinese wedding customs have changed a lot, but the ceremony is still very grand. The wedding venue is carefully decorated,with the main color ofred,a symbol ofjubilance,and many objects are placed to wish the couple happiness.At the wedding,the couple willbowtoHeavenandEarth,to theirparents and to eachother,andthenholdabanquet toentertainthe guestsand toast the guests to express their gratitude.Today,many young people still prefer the traditionalChinese wedding,to experience the unique andbeautifulChinese romance.",
            "notes": "1.第一句：本句由三个小句构成，第一个小句“中国的传统婚礼习俗历史悠久”翻译为Traditional wedding customs inChina have a long history，“历史悠久”即have a long history；第二个小句和第一个小句用and连 接，可翻译为and since the ZhouDynasty acompletesetofweddingrituals has graduallydeveloped；第三个小句 可翻译为非限制性定语从句，即some ofwhich are still in use today，修饰第二个小句中的weddingrituals。 2.第二句：前后两个分句为转折关系，用but连接即可，翻译时需要注意两个分句的时态。 3.第三句：该句由三个小句构成，主干“婚礼场地经过精心装饰”翻译为The wedding venue iscarefully decorated，而“以象征喜庆的红色为主色调”表示补充说明，翻译为with介词短语，即withthemaincolor ofred，a symbol ofjubilance，其中a symbolofjubilance是对red的补充说明；“摆放着许多祝愿新人幸福的 物件”是无主语句，可翻译为被动语态的形式，即many objects are placed to wish the couple happiness，其中 “许多祝愿新人幸福的”原本是定语，根据英文表达习惯，翻译成表示目的的不定式短语towishthecouple happiness。 4.第四句：本句的翻译难点在于一系列的动作，“拜天地，拜父母和相互对拜”中三个动作为并列关系，共同 使用一个动词，故翻译为bowto Heavenand Earth，to their parents andto eachother；“然后设宴招待宾客”翻 译为and连接的并列谓语动词短语，即and then hold a banquet to entertain the guests；“并向宾客敬酒致谢”翻 译为and toast the guests to express their gratitude。 5.第五句：该句由两个小句构成，第二个小句“体验独特而美好的中国式浪漫”是前一小句中“依然钟情于 传统的中式婚礼”的目的，故翻译成不定式短语作目的状语，即to experience the unique and beautifulChinese romance。 2024年6月大学英语六级考试 第一套 答案速查 PartⅡListening Comprehension 1.B 2.A 11.B 12.D 21.D 22.D 3.C 4.C 5.A 6.B 7.A 8.D 9.A 10.B 13.C 14.C 15.D 16.A 17.C 18.B 19.A 20.B 23.A 24.D 25.C Reading Comprehension PartIII 26.A 27.I 36.C 37.H 46.B 47.D 20六级2024.6第一套 28.B 29.D 30.C 31.0 32.M 33.L 34.E 35.N 38.B 39.K 40.I 41.D 42.N 43.J 44.E 45.0 48.A 49.D 50.C 51.D 52.C 53.A 54.B 55.A",
