                "analysis": "【答案】 B （细节题） It was based on experiments under conditions unlike those in most homes or offices. 【定位】 P2 The problem lies in the fact that NASA conducted their tests in sealed containers that do not simulate the conditions in most people's homes or offices. 问题在于，NASA 是在密封容器里做的实验，而这种容器并不能模拟大多数人家里或办公室的环境。 【信号】 The problem lies in 明示缺陷 。The problem lies in the fact that 是直接点题的标志，问题就在这句之后——这正是题干 the problem 的对应落点。 【替换】 sealed containers that do not simulate the conditions in most people's homes or offices ↔ It was based on experiments under conditions unlike those in most homes or offices. do not simulate=unlike 【排除】 A) 原词陷阱 NASA did experiments in sealed containers resembling the super insulated offices of 1970s. 把录音真出现的 sealed containers 和 super insulated 两处原词硬拼，还说密封舱『像 1970 年代办公室』——录音说密封舱『不模拟』普通环境，二者恰恰不像，属张冠李戴式拼接。 借用原文：sealed containers that do not simulate the conditions C) 过度推断 NASA conducted tests in outer space whose environment is different from ours. 借了录音 space stations 的太空联想，但录音说实验是在 sealed containers 里做的，从没说在 outer space 做测试，属无中生有。 借用原文：keeping the air fresh for astronauts cut off in biospheres or space stations D) 未提及 It drew its conclusion without any contrastive data from other experiments. 说该研究『缺对照数据』，录音指出的缺陷是『实验条件不真实』，从未提缺对照数据，属未提及。"
