                "analysis": "【答案】 A （细节题） Natural ventilation proves much more efficient for cleaning the air than houseplants. 【定位】 P3 However, a new evaluation of dozens of studies spanning 30 years found that houseplants in a normal environment have little impact. In fact, natural ventilation is far better at cleaning the air. 然而，一项跨越 30 年、对数十项研究的新评估发现，正常环境下的室内植物作用甚微。事实上，自然通风在净化空气方面要好得多。 【信号】 However 转折后是真结论 。However, a new evaluation 用 However 把语气从『植物有用』扭向新结论，转折之后的两句才是答案落点，尤其 In fact, natural ventilation is far better 是核心。 【替换】 natural ventilation is far better at cleaning the air ↔ Natural ventilation proves much more efficient for cleaning the air than houseplants. far better=much more efficient 【排除】 B) 原词陷阱 Houseplants disperse chemical compounds more quickly with people moving around. 盗用了录音 disperse the compounds 和 movement of people 两处原词，却说『植物因人走动散得更快』；录音的意思是建筑本身的换气率（人来人往开门窗）远高于植物的散播率，是在贬低植物，而非夸植物散得快，方向被偷换。 借用原文：the rate at which plants disperse the compounds was well below the usual rate of air exchange C) 过度推断 Natural ventilation turns out to be most effective with doors and windows wide open. 借了录音 opening doors and windows 的原词，却加上『most effective / wide open』这种录音没说的最高级和条件；录音只说通风比植物好，没说门窗全开才最有效。 借用原文：opening doors and windows D) 偷换概念 Houseplants in a normal environment rarely have any adverse impact on the air. 几乎照搬了录音 houseplants in a normal environment have little impact，但把 little impact（作用甚微）偷换成 rarely have any adverse impact（几乎无害）——录音说的是植物『没多大净化作用』，不是说植物『无害』，含义跑偏。 借用原文：houseplants in a normal environment have little impact"
