                "analysis": "【答案】 C （细节题） The woman will be off work on the next two Mondays. 【定位】 P5 W: Would it be possible to take the next two Mondays off? ... M: Sure thing. ... M: So this is what we're going to do. You will take those days off, and I expect that you will gradually come back to your usual self. 女：能让我接下来两个周一请假吗？……男：当然可以。……男：那我们就这么办，你把那两天休掉，我希望你慢慢恢复到平时的状态。 【信号】 请求—应允—拍板三处合一 。女方提出 take the next two Mondays off，男方 Sure thing 应允，结尾再 So this is what we're going to do. You will take those days off 拍板；\"请求被应允并在结尾确认\"是约定题的答案信号。 【替换】 take the next two Mondays off ↔ be off work on the next two Mondays take...off=be off work 同义替换 You will take those days off ↔ The woman will be off work 结尾确认句坐实主语是女方 【排除】 A) 原词陷阱 A 说 resume her work in two weeks（两周后复工），但原文女方只是休\"两个周一\"、并非停工两周后才回来；\"two\"原词在，时间概念却被偷换，且 in two months 才是再约谈时间，A 张冠时间。 借用原文：take the next two Mondays off B) 张冠李戴 B 说 The man will be back at his 100%，但原文 What I need is for you to be back at your 100% 是男方要求\"你（女方）\"回到100%，主语该是女方不是男方；盗用 100% 原词却把人安反，属张冠李戴。 借用原文：What I need is for you to be back at your 100% D) 过度推断 D 说 The man will help the woman get back to her usual self，但原文是男方期望\"你会慢慢恢复\"you will gradually come back to your usual self，是女方自己恢复，并非男方\"帮\"她；盗 usual self 原词却脑补出\"帮助\"，属过度推断。 借用原文：you will gradually come back to your usual self"
